  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>As&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced></math>, is polynomial function, so&nbsp;it is continuous and differentiable in <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\" separators=\"|\"><mn>0,1</mn></mfenced></math>.</p><p>Here <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mn>0</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>11</mn></math>, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mn>1</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>11</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>16</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>f</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>8</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>8</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><msup><mi>f</mi><mo>.</mo></msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi>c</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mn>1</mn></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mn>0</mn></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>16</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>11</mn></mrow><mn>1</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>c</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>8</mn><mi>c</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>8</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>c</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>8</mn><mi>c</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math><mi>c</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>8</mn><mo>&#177;</mo><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>7</mn></msqrt></mrow><mrow><mn>6</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>&#177;</mo><msqrt><mn>7</mn></msqrt></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"